{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<each "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"query"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Query","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Query"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryView","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryViewV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"QueryView"},{"kind":"text","text":"<repeat (each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":")."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm\/Value","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP5ValueQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Value"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" repeat each "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/QueryTerm","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"QueryTerm"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The entities to visit and the components to read."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"query"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A view of the matching rows, as of this moment."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each row is a tuple of the entity, labeled "},{"code":"entity","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", followed by one value per term: the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"component for a component term, and a tuple of optionals for an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" term. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"following example reads the name of every entity pushed by wind, thrust or both, with the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"forces it feels:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var world = World()","world.spawn(Name(value: \"kite\"), Wind(force: 3))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rocket\"), Thrust(force: 5))","world.spawn(Name(value: \"rock\"))","","var forces: [String] = []","for (_, name, (wind, thrust)) in world.query(Query(Name.self, AnyOf<Wind, Thrust>.self)) {","    forces.append(\"\\(name.value): \\((wind?.force ?? 0) + (thrust?.force ?? 0))\")","}","print(forces)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"kite: 3.0\", \"rocket: 5.0\"]\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The rock holds neither a wind nor a thrust, so it doesn’t match the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/AnyOf"},{"type":"text","text":" term."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The view is lazy: it finds the matching entities as you iterate it.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"t","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" terms to create. Iterating is O("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" entities in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smallest component term or required type, or every entity when there’s none."}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Querying-Entities","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:)-zacg","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:_:_:)","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:)-3e8od","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query()"],"title":"Querying Entities"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the entities that match a query, with the values of its terms.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/query(_:)-4yi98","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/world\/query(_:)-4yi98"]}],"metadata":{"title":"query(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"query"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule5QueryV","text":"Query","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryViewV","text":"QueryView","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<repeat (each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":").","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9QueryTermP5ValueQa","text":"Value","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A0V5queryyAA9QueryViewVy5ValueQzxQp_QPGA